{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51002","headline":"又一首（用前韵） · 詹敦仁","name":"又一首（用前韵）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可恨名存实已除，兰台芸阁复谁居？\n豕鱼未识应多愧，尤恐在人成蠹书。\n（以上二诗见《永乐大典》卷一九七八二「一屋」。\n「局」字〖十八函一百七十八册〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}